## PETSc options for cardio-dance monodomain solver.
## Activated when use_petsc=1 in the .options file. Loaded via PETSC_OPTIONS
## env var or PetscInitializeFile.
##
## Solver: CG with Additive Schwarz preconditioner.
##  - pc_type asm: Additive Schwarz Method (overlapping subdomain solves)
##  - pc_asm_overlap 1: 1-element overlap between subdomains
##  - sub_pc_type ilu: ILU(0) factorization on each local subdomain
##  - ksp_max_it / ksp_rtol mirror our SimulationConfig values
##
## All options are prefixed "mono_" to match the MFEM PetscLinearSolver
## constructor in LinearSolverFactory.cpp.

-mono_ksp_type cg
-mono_ksp_max_it 500
-mono_ksp_rtol 1e-8
-mono_ksp_norm_type unpreconditioned
-mono_pc_type asm
-mono_pc_asm_overlap 1
-mono_sub_pc_type ilu
-mono_sub_pc_factor_levels 0
